# Vulnerabilities and misconfigurations the security scans (.github/workflows/security.yml)
# accept. One ID per line, with an expiry, and a comment above it saying why it's accepted:
#
#   # Only reachable through the X CLI's Y command, which the sandbox never runs.
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2027-01-31
#
# An entry past its `exp:` date no longer applies, so the scan fails again and the acceptance is
# looked at again. Keep this list short: prefer fixing (a newer base image digest or CLI pin).
